  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted ( Site Location Plan; 18180_01_P Rev A); drawing no. 18180_02_P Rev A); 18180_03_ES Rev A) (received 14/05/2013)  therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 3 - No infiltration of surface water drainage into the ground is permitted other than with the express written consent of the local planning authority, which may be given for those parts of the site where it has been demonstrated that there is no resultant unacceptable risk to controlled waters. The development shall be carried out in accordance with the approval details.",
    "Condition : 4 - The rating level of noise emitted from fixed plant on the site, shall be lower than the existing background noise level by 10dB. The noise levels shall be determined at the nearest noise sensitive locations. The levels shall be determined according to BS4142:1997.\r\n",
    "Condition : 5 - Prior to the implementation of the flexible use hereby approved, a Travel Plan shall be submitted for the written approval of the Local Planning Authority in accordance with the aims and objectives of Hounslow's '10 Point Guide for Travel Plans'. The approved Travel Plan shall be implemented and monitored in accordance with the approved details and for each subsequent occupation of the development thereafter maintain and develop the Travel Plan in accordance with the agreed principles. \r\n",
    "Condition : 6 - Prior to the implementation of the flexible use hereby approved, a Delivery and Servicing Plan shall be submitted to, and approved in writing by, the Local Planning Authority. The uses shall be carried out in accordance with the approved details. \r\n"
  ],
